{"v":4,"catch":"在一間單間公寓裡擊退成群的殭屍！","desc":"這是一款生存動作遊戲，你將在有限的房間空間內與成群的殭屍戰鬥。\n\n攻擊是自動的，所以操作很簡單，只需要移動和改變方向。\n\n升級，尋找寶箱，選擇更多武器。\n\n打造最強陣容，生存！\n\n使用戰鬥中獲得的金幣升級你的初始武器和屬性。\n\n從打造符合你喜好的陣容開始你的冒險之旅！","publisher":"AlignmentSharp","release":"2026-11-26","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","葡萄牙文","德文","義大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"限制級","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4dfa52c128aeb3a5d7942bdb941fe27dc7934a0b8bbf8e201e6485b6d2019627.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd661abb0f64ca6b770fa04c835dabaebfdfe114890e28095ba58791c896ee32.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0a43fa063ce9edd089b9e863bd50cb9cacdeb25b608b9bffe2657833afa2792.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/20a13aa307155aa44e965f656ac0dec17bf0a1662350ecbea2234e4b59a42b08.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/be0a025b34bed33e3db0acdf010e5da7f9b584afd3c609701c1474ea2c0903b5.jpg"],"titleId":"010034002a90c000","demo":["70030000026129"],"dlc":[]}